<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia rate cut to lift housing - industry.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia rate cut to lift housing - industry.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Estate Institute of Australia president Don Brindley said on Wednesday the latest interest rate cut would boost the housing market.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite interest rate cuts earlier this year, there is still a shortage of first home buyers in the market,&quot; Brindley said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia cut interest rates by 0.5 percentage points to 6.0 percent earlier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
